SUMMARY:Live Music in the Perspective Café
DESCRIPTION:Join us in the Perspective Café for an afternoon of music and art in the Museum. With a soundscape of live music\, we invite you to soak in the atmosphere of the Perspective Café in a more emotional and sensory way. \nBuncombe county residents always receive 20% off general admission prices. \nRESERVE TICKETS NOW \nABOUT THE MUSICIAN\nAscension is an Asheville based band performing original compositions based on traditional Arabic and African dance rhythms. Their compositions are spacious\, unique\, and allow each musician to improvise within the whole.
