SUMMARY:Sunday Sounds | Lo Wolf
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an afternoon of music and art in the Museum. With a soundscape of harp music\, we invite you to experience artwork in the galleries in a more emotional and sensory way. \nABOUT THE MUSICIAN\nCaptivated at an early age by this incredible instrument\, Lo has a unique and improvisational style honed by years of study in the classical and Celtic modes. She brings her singer-songwriter sensibilities to bear and draws on the world around her to create soothing and memorable soundscapes that reflect the beauty she sees. \nRESERVE TICKETS NOW
